{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-99-1","title":"Psalms 99:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":99,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":99,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The prophet, setting forth the kingdom of God in Zion, 5 exhorts all, by the example of their forefathers, to worship God at his holy hill.</p>\n<p>Lord. 2:6; 93:1; 96:10; 97:1; Lu 19:12,14; Re 11:17 people. 2:11,12; 21:8,9; 97:4; Lu 19:27; Php 2:12 he sitteth. 18:10; 80:1; Ex 25:22; Eze 10:1-22 earth. 82:5; *marg: Jer 4:24; 5:22; 49:21; 50:46; Re 6:14; 20:11 be moved. Heb. stagger. Isa 19:14; 24:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-99-2","title":"Psalms 99:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":99,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":99,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>great. 48:1-3; 50:2; 76:1,2; Isa 12:6; 14:32; Heb 12:22-24; Re 14:1-5 high. 66:7; 97:9; Da 4:34,35; Jas 4:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-99-3","title":"Psalms 99:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":99,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":99,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>thy great. 66:3; 76:12; De 7:21; 28:58; Ne 1:5; 4:14; 9:32; Jer 20:11 for it. 111:9; 145:17; Jos 24:19; 1Sa 2:2; Isa 6:3; Joh 17:11; Re 4:8 Re 15:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-99-4","title":"Psalms 99:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":99,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":99,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>strength. 45:6,7; 72:1,2; De 32:3,4; 2Sa 23:3,4; Job 36:5-7; 37:23 Isa 11:3-5; Jer 23:5; Re 19:11,16 thou dost. Isa 9:7; 42:4; 61:11 executest. De 10:18; Jude 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-99-5","title":"Psalms 99:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":99,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":99,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Exalt. 9; 21:13; 34:3; 108:5; Ex 15:2; Isa 12:4; 25:1; Ho 11:7 footstool. 132:7; 1Ch 28:2; Isa 66:1 he is holy. or, it is holy. 3; Le 19:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-99-6","title":"Psalms 99:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":99,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":99,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Moses. Ex 24:6-8; 29:11-37; 40:23-29; Nu 16:47,48 they called. Ex 14:15; 15:25; 32:11-14; 33:12-15; Nu 14:13-20; 16:21,22 1Sa 7:9-12; 12:18-24; Jer 15:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-99-7","title":"Psalms 99:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":99,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":99,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>in the cloudy. Ex 19:9; 33:9; Nu 12:5 kept. Ex 40:16; Nu 16:15; De 4:5; 33:9; 1Sa 12:3-5; Pr 28:9; Heb 3:2 1Jo 3:21,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-99-8","title":"Psalms 99:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":99,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":99,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>thou wast. 89:33; Nu 14:20; De 9:19; Jer 46:28; Zep 3:7 through. Ex 32:2,34,35; Nu 11:33,34; 14:20-34; 20:12,24; De 3:26; 9:20 their inventions. Ec 7:29; Ro 1:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-99-9","title":"Psalms 99:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":99,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":99,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>Exalt. 5 his holy. 2:6; 48:1,2; 87:1-3 for the. 3,5; 1Sa 2:2; Isa 5:16; 6:3; 57:15; Hab 1:12; Lu 1:49; 1Pe 1:15,16 Re 3:7; 4:8</p>"}]}